# Vercel serves the pre-built Flutter bundle in build/web (see vercel.json:
# buildCommand null, outputDirectory build/web) because Vercel has no Flutter
# SDK — the bundle is built locally by `flutter build web --release`.
#
# Without this file Vercel falls back to .gitignore, whose "/build/" rule means
# the bundle is never uploaded and the deploy silently ships whatever was there
# before. So: ignore everything, then re-include build/web only. That also
# keeps the 143 MB .dart_tool cache out of the upload.
/*
!/build
/build/*
!/build/web
